          "text": "-----BEGIN FILE id=\"ef2d9a\" type=\"text/plain\"-----\nAsia is the largest and most diverse continent on Earth, stretching from the snowy mountains of Siberia to the tropical islands of Southeast Asia. It is home to ancient civilizations, modern megacities, thousands of languages, and countless cultural traditions. In one part of Asia, you can find peaceful temples surrounded by cherry blossoms, while in another, futuristic skylines glow with neon lights late into the night.\n-----END FILE id=\"ef2d9a\"-----",
